Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libpam0g, libtss2-esys-3.0.2-0t64 | libtss2-esys-3.0.2-0 | libtss2-esys0, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-gtk-4.0
Description: Windows Hello-style TPM 2.0 PIN authentication for Linux
 Hardware-backed PIN authentication using TPM 2.0. Integrates with PAM
 for login screen (GDM/SDDM), lock screen, sudo, and desktop keyring auto-unlock.
 Includes a native GTK4/Libadwaita settings application.
